   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The main test (call 16) compares the written files with the option table they were\nwritten from. It confirms the copy, not the options: 35 of the 51 options were never run,\namong them -D (runs a command per match), -r (deletes files) and -M (extracts recursively).",
   "originalText": "The main test (call 16) compares the written files with the option table they were\nwritten from. It confirms the copy, not the options: 35 of the 51 options were never run,\namong them -D (runs a command per match), -r (deletes files) and -M (extracts recursively).",
