   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Isolation: one folder, T=$(mktemp -d /tmp/bwtest.XXXX); cd $T; - with ';', so a failed\nmktemp would have sent the probes to the home folder (as in run 5). The -E -J probe also\nwrote matplotlib's font cache to ~/.cache, outside that folder. Scratch deleted in call 17.",
   "originalText": "Isolation: one folder, T=$(mktemp -d /tmp/bwtest.XXXX); cd $T; - with ';', so a failed\nmktemp would have sent the probes to the home folder (as in run 5). The -E -J probe also\nwrote matplotlib's font cache to ~/.cache, outside that folder. Scratch deleted in call 17.",
